  day: 2
  text: "How\u2019s it going, big boss? Heard you were set up yesterday. Nothing
    to worry about, they do that to everyone. \u201CTeach us a lesson\u201D or something
    like that. Hey, you just keep doing what you do and everything\u2019s gonna be
    alright. But I haven\u2019t forgotten about those tasty details. I can tell you
    that the two best miners in this place are Marcus and Edvin. So if you want to
    use the mine for their optimal output, send one of them in!"
